{"3773390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Kingcrab Simulator", "steam_appid": 3773390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/4652842d7a99d3e1204ba8d678e30686.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/4652842d7a99d3e1204ba8d678e30686.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Kingcrab Simulator</strong> is a third-person destruction action (semi) open-world adventure game where you become a mighty king crab, liberate countless kidnapped crabs, and lay waste to major cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a giant and powerful Super Kingcrab—smash buildings, destroy crab restaurants, and rescue your fellow crabs.</strong><br>Progress through the chaos and ultimately destroy the cities to escape the world of humanity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/a3567f80838a8aa7a862f8aa51c5f9a8.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/a3567f80838a8aa7a862f8aa51c5f9a8.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.poster.avif?t=1770129918\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.webm?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.mp4?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the most powerful of all king crabs — the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy buildings and strip humans of their shelters!<br>Rip out the ruins and hurl them to devastate nearby towns and cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are so many targets around you waiting to be destroyed...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/c63d9797d86af81e454abd2bc786090c.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/c63d9797d86af81e454abd2bc786090c.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.poster.avif?t=1770129918\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.webm?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.mp4?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't destroy buildings and fight humans all by yourself...<br><strong>Because a king crab is never alone. There are many of you—many crabs!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You <strong>must</strong> liberate the others.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crabs will fight by your side…<br>Free one crab, and it will help you free more.<br>Work together to liberate even more king crabs somewhere out there…!!<br>And together, let's bring total ruin to this hellish world!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/d51cd3348919a70602f626952648d4d5.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/d51cd3348919a70602f626952648d4d5.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's a great question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist… the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>, <br>set out on a journey after noticing that many of his kind were mysteriously disappearing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>But during his journey, he witnessed something truly horrifying…</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/b710565ff961001e0418a965cbeb4ff3.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/b710565ff961001e0418a965cbeb4ff3.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A city where humans were eating king crabs.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, our king crab has a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To prevent more crabs from being devoured, he must destroy the crab restaurants.<br>And he must annihilate the cities of the humans who feasted on his kin — by any means necessary.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/4652842d7a99d3e1204ba8d678e30686.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/4652842d7a99d3e1204ba8d678e30686.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Kingcrab Simulator</strong> is a third-person destruction action (semi) open-world adventure game where you become a mighty king crab, liberate countless kidnapped crabs, and lay waste to major cities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become a giant and powerful Super Kingcrab—smash buildings, destroy crab restaurants, and rescue your fellow crabs.</strong><br>Progress through the chaos and ultimately destroy the cities to escape the world of humanity!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/a3567f80838a8aa7a862f8aa51c5f9a8.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/a3567f80838a8aa7a862f8aa51c5f9a8.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.poster.avif?t=1770129918\" width=800 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.webm?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/3632ec4ec31341534566dd0173fe2e5d.mp4?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You are the most powerful of all king crabs — the <strong>Super Kingcrab</strong>.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy buildings and strip humans of their shelters!<br>Rip out the ruins and hurl them to devastate nearby towns and cities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There are so many targets around you waiting to be destroyed...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/c63d9797d86af81e454abd2bc786090c.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/c63d9797d86af81e454abd2bc786090c.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.poster.avif?t=1770129918\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.webm?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/18d54f11ef11383bdb69758be5de2817.mp4?t=1770129918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't destroy buildings and fight humans all by yourself...<br><strong>Because a king crab is never alone. There are many of you—many crabs!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You <strong>must</strong> liberate the others.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The crabs will fight by your side…<br>Free one crab, and it will help you free more.<br>Work together to liberate even more king crabs somewhere out there…!!<br>And together, let's bring total ruin to this hellish world!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras/d51cd3348919a70602f626952648d4d5.avif?t=1770129918\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3773390/extras_big/d51cd3348919a70602f626952648d4d5.avif?t=1770129918 width=800 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >